This allowed a complete resolution of all rheumatologic and 
intestinal signs, while the GAD65 antibody dramatically 
decreased to the minimal threshold of its detection (Table 
1; 1 1 mUA/mL; N<5) in the serum. As for the biliary tract 
dilatation, a slight improvement with attenuation of stenosis 
